    "title": "Professor Stephane Pradines Talks about the \"Journal of Material Cultures in the Muslim World\"",
    "subtitle": "AKU-ISMC Publications",
    "summary": "Editor-in-chief Professor Stephane Pradines explains how the Journal  has become the go-to publication for many people and fields.",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "a6e498aae11a5367",
